    "group": "Vow-sworn Crusaders",
    "summary": "As battle round 1 opens, you may pick one **Vow** for your **ADEPTUS ASTARTES** units; it stays active until the battle ends.\n\n**Abhor the Witch, Destroy the Witch**: melee attacks against a **PSYKER** unit gain **[[PRECISION]](vsdata:weapon-ability/precision)** and **[[LANCE]](vsdata:weapon-ability/lance)**.\n\n**Accept Any Challenge, No Matter the Odds**: melee attacks get +1 to **[wound rolls](vsdata:core-rule/wound-rolls)** when the target's **T** exceeds the attack's **S**.\n\n**Uphold the Honour of the Emperor**: your **INFANTRY** units gain both of these:\n\n- As your [Movement phase](vsdata:core-rule/movement-phase) ends, any **[objective](vsdata:core-rule/objectives)** such a unit controls is **[secured](vsdata:core-rule/secured-objectives)**.\n- An **[advance move](vsdata:core-rule/advance-move)** still lets the unit **[start an action](vsdata:core-rule/performing-actions)**.\n\n**Restrictions:** **BLACK TEMPLARS** units are permitted; **ADEPTUS ASTARTES** units from another Chapter are not.",
